{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ByteCoin.png?t=1753698362\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/LightCoin.png?t=1753698362\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/DoggoCoin.png?t=1753698362\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/Mysterium.png?t=1753698362\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 10 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"hi